      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Brazil and Peru are the South American countries.\n\nBrazil has \\(4+7=11\\) stamps before the ‘\\(70\\)s, costing \\(11\\cdot6=66\\) cents. Peru has \\(6+4=10\\) such stamps, costing \\(10\\cdot4=40\\) cents.\n\nThe total cost is \\(66+40=106\\) cents, or \\(\\$1.06.\\)\n\nThus, B is the correct answer.",
